        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "結婚を機に、二人は新しい土地での門出を選んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "就職という門出を前に、期待と不安が入り混じっている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「おめでとう！これが君の新しい人生の門出になるんだね！」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
